Meanwhile, we have now created this really complex and like important rule set that is enforced by referees,
to make sure that we can continue to have this competition so that we can continue to see the greatest warriors who have ever existed

1629
01:37:35,590 --> 01:37:35,910
与此同时，我们现在建立了一套非常复杂且重要的规则体系，由裁判执行，
