2459
02:22:16,910 --> 02:22:22,490
而且他们，是的，我记得第一次见到来自新加坡政府的人时，因为当时我正在经营一家初创公司。
And they, yeah, like, I remember the first time I met people from the Singaporean government, because I was running a startup.

2460
02:22:22,730 --> 02:22:24,430
就是，你知道，一个 AI 初创公司。
Just, you know, like an AI startup.

2461
02:22:24,550 --> 02:22:25,190
我们是做 AI 安全的。
We were in AI safety.

2462
02:22:25,310 --> 02:22:26,290
那时候我们还没什么名气。
We weren't really well known yet.

2463
02:22:26,430 --> 02:22:29,610
结果竟然收到了来自新加坡政府的邮件。
And we got an email from the Singaporean government of all people.

2464
02:22:30,030 --> 02:22:31,870
他们说：你好，我们是新加坡政府。
And they were like, hello, we are the Singaporean government.

2465
02:22:32,174 --> 02:22:33,990
我们正试图了解 AI 和 AI 安全。
We are trying to learn about AI and AI safety.

2466
02:22:34,286 --> 02:22:35,730
我们听说你们对这个领域非常了解。
We heard that you know a lot about this.

2467
02:22:35,918 --> 02:22:38,244
如果我们过来问你们一堆问题，可以吗？
would it be fine if we came by and ask you a bunch of questions?

2468
02:22:38,862 --> 02:22:41,250
我就想，当然可以，这看起来是个非常合理的请求。
And I'm like, sure, that seems like a very reasonable thing to do.

2469
02:22:41,990 --> 02:22:46,650
于是来了三个非常合理、很友好的年轻人，拿出了他们的 iPad。
