2470
02:22:46,750 --> 02:22:48,710
他们去哪儿找你见面的？
Where did they come to see you at?

2471
02:22:48,850 --> 02:22:49,830
当时我在伦敦。
I was in London at the time.

2472
02:22:49,850 --> 02:22:50,350
你在伦敦。
You were in London.

2473
02:22:50,542 --> 02:22:53,750
所以他们飞过来了，几个挺不错的年轻公务员，大概三十多岁的。
So they flew out, some nice young civil servants, like in their thirties.

2474
02:22:54,094 --> 02:22:56,430
他们出来，拿出平板电脑，拿出了笔记。
They came out, they took out their iPads, took out their notes.

2475
02:22:56,610 --> 02:22:58,670
我就说，嘿，非常感谢你们抽时间过来。
And I'm like, hey, thank you so much for taking the time.

2476
02:22:58,830 --> 02:23:03,150
他们问了我很多关于技术、以及可以采取哪些监管措施的细节问题。
They asked me a bunch of really detailed questions about the technology, about what regulation could be done.

2477
02:23:03,350 --> 02:23:04,410
“如果我们这样做会发生什么？”
What would happen if we did this?

2478
02:23:04,450 --> 02:23:05,350
“我对这事儿怎么看？”
What did I think about this?

2479
02:23:05,350 --> 02:23:06,650
他们把每一件事都记了下来。
took notes about every single thing.

2480
02:23:06,730 --> 02:23:07,870
