正如你所知，制定立法需要一点时间。
It's going to take a bit of time, as you know, to create legislation.

2483
02:23:11,410 --> 02:23:13,110
所以，你知道的，我们可能不会马上看到相关立法。
So, you know, we probably won't see legislation.

2484
02:23:13,330 --> 02:23:14,468
可能会花上，你知道的，三到六个月。
Might take us, you know, three to six months.

2485
02:23:15,246 --> 02:23:16,150
我就想，三到六个月？
I'm like, three to six months?

2486
02:23:16,878 --> 02:23:17,310
我的天呐。
Oh my God.

2487
02:23:17,890 --> 02:23:19,510
他们对此感到很抱歉。
That's like, they were apologetic about it.

2488
02:23:19,550 --> 02:23:20,410
就像在说，噢，我们太抱歉了。
Like, oh, we're so sorry.

2489
02:23:20,490 --> 02:23:22,468
就像，你可能要等三到六个月才能收到我们的回复。
Like, you probably won't hear back from us for like three to six months.

2490
02:23:22,530 --> 02:23:23,210
我就想，这太不可思议了。
I'm like, that's incredible.

2491
02:23:24,686 --> 02:23:28,290
所以很有趣的是，从某种意义上说，这其实很正常。
And so it's very interesting that in a sense, it was very normal.

2492
02:23:28,810 --> 02:23:34,550
这些人只是些年轻、有能力的专业人士，你知道，牛津、
剑桥毕业的，受过良好教育，只是在政府部门工作。
It's just, these were just young, competent people, you know, Oxford, you know, Cambridge,
educated people that just work for the government.

2493
02:23:35,130 --> 02:23:40,250
这里有几点，虽然我不是新加坡方面的专家，但他们确实有一些明显的做法。
And so here's a couple, like, you know, I'm not an expert on everything Singapore, but there's a couple obvious things they do.

2494
02:23:40,430 --> 02:23:44,070
比如，他们会参考私营部门来制定公职人员的薪资标准。
One thing is, for example, they benchmark their public salaries by the private sector.

2495
02:23:44,846 --> 02:23:48,890
所以如果你在公共部门工作，你的收入和在科技公司工作是一样的。
So if you take a public sector job, you make the same money as if you worked at a tech company.

2496
02:23:50,410 --> 02:23:51,330
显然这是件好事。
Obviously a good thing to do.

2497
02:23:51,690 --> 02:23:51,870
是的。
Yeah.

2498
02:23:52,010 --> 02:23:53,790
显然我们应该支付同等的报酬。
Obviously we should pay the same amount.

2499
02:23:54,050 --> 02:23:59,730
如果你是顶尖人才，比如你是顶级科技高管，你想为政府工作，我们就应该给你同样的待遇。
If you're a top talent, if you're like a top tier tech executive and
you want to work for the government, we should pay you the same money.

2500
02:24:00,170 --> 02:24:01,090
这是非常合理的做法。
Very reasonable thing to do.

2501
02:24:01,550 --> 02:24:12,570
比如在 Singapore，他们有一个项目，如果是个年轻的新加坡人，并且被全球前十的大学录取了，
比如牛津之类的，他们会资助你所有的费用。
Another thing they, for example, do in Singapore is they have a program where if you're a young Singaporean and you are accepted into
like a top 10 university in the world, like Oxford or something, they will pay for your whole thing.

2502
02:24:12,810 --> 02:24:13,830
他们会支付全部的教育费用。
They'll pay for the whole education.

2503
02:24:14,070 --> 02:24:15,050
他们会报销你在那里的所有生活费。
They'll pay for your whole stay there.

